Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的眼睛有点痒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, my eye is a little itchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, mine too. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼睛好红喔  你应该去看我的眼科医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, it's really red. You should go see my eye doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查  我才不要找你的前男友看眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Richard? I'm not gonna go see your ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理查  一天到晚理查个没完\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Richard, that's all I ever hear. Richard, Richard, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.11,0:00:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打从我们开始约会以后  我想我只提过两次他的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Since we've been going out, I think I've mentioned his name twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好  理查  理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So Richard, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是理查啦  我新找的眼科医生  他很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not Richard, okay? It's this new guy. He's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我不去看眼科医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. I'm not going to an eye doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  老毛病又犯了  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God. Here we go. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次只要提到眼睛这档事  她马上就避之唯恐不及\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any time anything comes close to touching her eye or anyone else's.she, like, freaks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你别闹了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:01:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我对我的眼睛有怪癖  麻烦别再讨论了  行吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, fine. I have a weird thing with my eye. Can we not talk about it please?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.35,0:01:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  还记得有首很棒的歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach. You know that great song?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,," 我"  我自己和( " 我" 和" 眼睛" 同音）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, "Me, myself and eye."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  别闹啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aah! Monica. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.61,0:01:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有人想吃午餐  有意愿的请说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does anyone wanna get some lunch? All those in favor, say "eye."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  拜托  别闹了啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, stop it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有多喜欢《国王与我》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How much did I love The King and "Eye."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.78,0:01:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  别玩了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just stop it. That's enough. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧  对  我太兴奋了  戳到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You okay there, man? Yeah. I got too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.46,0:01:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第22集  眼病难医\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E22  The One With Joey's Big Break
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.56,0:01:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.27,0:01:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.65,0:01:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先走了  我要带班去公园\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I gotta go. I'm taking Ben to the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我亲下他  好  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, give him a kiss for me. All right. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  稍后见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye. Bye. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉让你们夹在中间尴尬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am so sorry you got caught in the middle of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是故意这么夸张  但我真的很生他的气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't mean to be so out there, but I am furious with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在克制  但一想到那个人我就有气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm trying, but, man, that guy can push my buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛那么气他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are you so mad at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.79,0:02:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想谈  好吗  只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I don't wanna talk about it, okay? Well, it seems like...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想榜上有名  就继续说啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanna be on my list too? Keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  谁有看到我的黑名单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Has anyone seen my list, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没看到  长什么样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, no. What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:03:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是张纸  上头写了" 罗斯"  了解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, a piece of paper and it says "Ross."  I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚和伊斯特讲完电话  你们猜怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. I just got off the phone with Estelle. and guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要当电影主角了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got the lead in a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要演电影主角  太厉害了  是什么电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got the lead in a movie? That's amazing! What's the movie about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,片名是《极限速度》  超酷的  \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's called Shutterspeed. It's really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在地铁遇见一个女孩  一天之内坠入情网\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, um, I meet this girl in the subway and we fall in love in, like, a day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来她消失无影无踪  但我找出了她住在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then she disappears. But I find out where she lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到那之后  一个老太太出来开门  我问她 "贝丝在哪里"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And when I get there, this old lady answers the door. I say, "Where's Betsy?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说 "贝丝已经过世十年了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right? And she says, "Betsy's been dead 10 years."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  毛骨悚然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh. Chilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最棒的部分是  拍片地点在赌城外的沙漠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, and the best part is we're filming in the desert outside of Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  你知道那是啥意思  对  我知道那是啥意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what that means, buddy. Yeah, I know that means buddy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开车杀过去  我们可以租车  我周二以前到那里就行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Road trip. Yeah, we can rent a car. I just have to be there by Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.76,0:03:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我祖母过世了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait. My grandmother's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   我们也可以聊聊那件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, uh, we can talk about that too, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:03:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  我是说她的计程车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, her cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她八成用不到了  你们可以开去赌城\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She probably won't be using it. You could drive it to Las Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  菲比  谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Thanks, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我的工作怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are we gonna do about my job?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别去了  好啊  太棒了  上路了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, uh, not go. All right, great. Road trip, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没意见吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你不用征求我的允许\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, you don't have to ask for my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我让你去  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can go. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.34,0:04:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  快点  要去看眼科了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach, come on, We're gonna be late for the eye doctor appointment
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  早去早解脱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Let's get this over with. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕  我真是笨手笨脚的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞得一团乱  我得先来清理一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, look at this mess.I mean, we're gonna probably have to clean this up, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看诊时间得要重约了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, we're gonna have to reschedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,若你认为这点脏乱会困扰我  那你就错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you thought that this mess was gonna bother me, you are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.24,0:04:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧  眨眼姑娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, let's go, Blinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:05:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, Joey. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法决定走哪条路去赌城\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't decide which route to take to Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你去过不少地方吧  对  见过世面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you've traveled a lot, right? Yeah, I've been around. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我该选哪一条  北线还是南线\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So which route should I take? The northern route or the southern route?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走北线途经伊利诺州  有个男人会用蜜峰当胡子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, if you take the north route, there's a man in Illinois with a beard of bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  问题解决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.69,0:05:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是走南线的话  可以看会玩井字游戏的鸡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But on the southern route, there's a chicken that plays tic-tac-toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.99,0:05:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又回到原点了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道有个方法能让你做决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I know a way that you can decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会问你一连串的问题  你回答得越快越好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'm gonna ask you a series of questions and you answer as quickly as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  不过先别急\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始了  你先放轻松\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here we go. Now I want you to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深呼吸一口气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心里不要想事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Clear your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花生酱和蛋白  你喜欢哪个  花生酱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which do you like better peanut butter or egg whites? Peanut butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,消防员和游泳选手  你比较想当哪一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which would you rather be a fireman or a swimmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,游泳选手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Swimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.31,0:05:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡和瑞秋  你比较想跟谁上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who would you rather sleep with Monica or Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都以为会是瑞秋呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I always thought it'd be Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要想事情  不要想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No thinking, no thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,领带或领巾  领巾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tie or ascot? Ascot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,南线或北线  北线\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}North route or south route? North.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:06.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,答案出现  厉害吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bam, there you go. Huh? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议  蜜峰胡  我来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was incredible. Beard of bees here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  这家伙又来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Oh, this guy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  没什么  今晚想看电影吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, not much. You guys wanna see a movie tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  你要看什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. What do you wanna see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们要如何决定  菲比  让他见识见识你的游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know how we can decide. Phoebe, show him your game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,免了  多谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, no, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  但我知道怎么决定了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. But I know how we can decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.85,0:06:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我问你问题  你要很快回答  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm gonna ask you questions and you answer real quick, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动作片或喜剧  你比较喜欢哪一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you like better action or comedy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.27,0:06:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动作片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Action.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡和瑞秋  你比较想跟谁上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who would you rather sleep with, Monica or Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  你真变态\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, you are sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我忘了你迷恋过瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. I'm sorry. I forgot you had that whole Rachel thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  这是干嘛的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. What does that thing do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是眼球摘除机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, that's an eye removal machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我要走了  开玩笑的啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'm out of here. I'm kidding. I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.68,0:07:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我是米勒医生  摩妮卡说你有点点紧张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Rachel, I'm Dr. Miller.Monica told me you were a little nervous,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过别担心  不会有事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but don't worry everything's gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就结束了  还差点  我们要先开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So we're done then. Almost, but first we gotta start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是青光眼测试\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is the glaucoma test.  Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请坐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.11,0:07:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把脸颊放在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Put your chin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  眼睛会有风吹的成觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, you'll feel a small puff of air in each eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,点点的风啦  你快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A small puff of air. Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here we go. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一  二  三\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这次不会动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha, I'm gonna stay in here this time. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ready? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一  二  抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One, two... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.89,0:07:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来抓她头好了  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what, I'm gonna hold her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:08:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一  二  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One two... Oh! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还年轻  应该没有青光眼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? You're young. You probably don't have glaucoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  很高兴认识您\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great!! It was very, very nice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你在干嘛  你疯了不成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ow! Hey, What are you doing?! Are you crazy? 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好   你的左眼有些微感染\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. You got a small, minor infection in that left eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这眼药水一天点三次  连续一周你就宛如新生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want you to take these drops three times a day and you'll be as good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不把任何东西放进眼睛里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, no, I don't-I don't put things in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧  三个月后再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay then. I guess we'll see you back here in three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  到时候我帮你装上假眼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. And I'll fit you for a glass eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  把那死眼药水给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, just give me the damn drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米勒医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dr. Miller?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}P E C F D\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}P-E-C-F-D.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  棒极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Very good, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.19,0:08:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道奖品放在哪里  我当然知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know where they are. I sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you don't get one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  那眼药水实在是太神奇了  我的眼睛百分之百好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, I-I gotta tell ya, those eye drops are a miracle. My eye is a 100% better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:05.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼药水还放在我的外套里 可恶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're still in my coat. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好上路了没有  好了  不过那边会有多冷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, you ready to go? Yeah, Listen, how cold is it gonna be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要带外套  还是带这些毛衣就够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do I need a coat or will all these sweater vests be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.97,0:09:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望罗斯也能一起去  我一定会很想念他的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, I wish Ross was coming with us. Y'know? I'm gonna miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是多谢你了  我才刚把那个混蛋给忘掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks a lot. I just got that jerk out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们住哪里  电影公司招待的饭店大套房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, so where are we staying? Is the movie putting us up in a big hotel suite?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不算是  这是独立制片的电影  没有太多预算\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, no, not really. It's an independent film. y'know? So we don't have a real big budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我住你房间好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I figured I'd just stay in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,了解  但等你拿到酬劳之后  你会请我住饭店大套房吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I see, but once you get your first paycheck, you'll be springing a big hotel suite, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演电影的片酬  一定不少吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Lead in the movie, they must be paying you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我算给你听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《极限速度》每赚一块钱  乔伊就能分到百分之一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For every dollar Shutterspeed makes one penny of it goes right in Joey's pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以电影赚钱  你才有钱拿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you don't get paid unless the movie makes money?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道这电影的情节吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you not hear the plot of the movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"贝丝已经过世十年了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"She's been dead for 10 years."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就快变成百万富翁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna be a millionaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要来跟你们说个再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanted to say goodbye to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便托你们帮我下个注\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And to see if maybe you guys will place a little bet for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.85,0:10:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,20美元押黑色15号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Twenty bucks on black 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.19,0:10:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got it. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  再见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Bye-bye, now.Bye, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去车子那里替你送行  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna say goodbye at the car. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁要去车子那里替我送行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anybody wanna say goodbye to me at the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以替你送行  只要你不介意我眼睛化脓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, honey, I'll say goodbye to you at the car if you don't mind the pus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  化脓是好现象  表示快要好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But wait a minute. The pus is good. It means it's healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你在看什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs. What you reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.06,0:10:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.23,0:10:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比别闹了啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoe-Phoebe! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我不知道你在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm sorry, I didn't see you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.82,0:11:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你在生我的气吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, are you mad at me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了什么让你生气的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'Cause if are please, tell me what it is I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.79,0:11:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道  我也帮不了你  我是不知道啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if you don't know, I can't help you. Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我也无能为力了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是什么事  我都非常抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, whatever it is, I am very, very sorry. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我接受你的道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Apology accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们没事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So we're, we're good? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那晚点见了  好吧  拜拜  大屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I'll uh, I'll see you later, okay? okay? Bye, fat ass
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你快点说  我做了什么让你这么不爽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe now come on!  will you please tell me what it is that made you so mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我不记得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然忘了  那能不能算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if you can't remember, can't we just forget about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  我生你的气  这很确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. I am mad at you. I know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我很抱歉骂你大屁股  因为你的小屁屁很可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I am sorry about the "fat ass" thing because you actually have a very sweet little heinie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我开得好累  你得随时准备接手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, I'm getting pretty tired. You're might have to take over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们才上路半小时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've been driving for a half-hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你都没在看路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you haven't looked at the road once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  路就是路嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry. It's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我该吃午饭了 是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I just need lunch. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要吃吗  我请客\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanna eat? My treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是罗斯的钱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't that Ross' money?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  好吧  罗斯请客\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay. Ross' treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想吃什么  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where do you wanna eat? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道要怎么决定了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, I know how we can decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我问你一堆问题  你得很快回答\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, uh, I'm gonna ask you questions.and then you have to answer real fast, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要想事情  什么都不要想  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, uh, clear your mind. Clear it right out. Clear it out.Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.55,0:12:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你宁愿太湿或太干  太干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you rather be too wet or too dry? Too dry.
