Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, you said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也说了会啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I also said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:13:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得我这次会翻身  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't think this is gonna be a big break for me? No! Ahhh!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,岂有此理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我只是不要你期望太高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Joe, I just, I just don't want you to get your hopes up too high.
