Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我不认为你这次能翻身\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because, Joe, I don't think this is going to be your big break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才来这趟   让我觉得自己是窝囊废\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that why you're on this trip? Huh? To make me feel like a loser?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是这样  那我宁愿自己去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'Cause if it is, I'll tell ya, I-I-I'd rather be alone.
