Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧  下次你再问那种问题  我骗你就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell you what,the next time you ask me a question like that, I'll lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我不要你一起去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I don't want you on the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  无所谓  你停车  我  马上走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, fine. Why don't you pull over? I'll get out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚吧  在桥上不能随便就停车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get out. You're not supposed to stop on a bridge.
