Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  桥上没有人行道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. Wait. There's no sidewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我一定会死在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I'm gonna die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你生我的气  是因为我发胶有怪味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, are you mad at me because my hair gel smells?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你生我的气  是因为我说你写字像小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you angry with me because I said your handwriting is childlike?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  这样才特别啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that made me feel precious.
