Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我心里想的也是四只\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, I was thinking four.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.85,0:15:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧   我们先来预演次  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, y'know what? why don't we start with a practice one, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.31,0:15:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不滴眼药水  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No drops. Great.
