Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把眼药水  滴进你眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aah!I am going to get Get these drops in your eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你的蛮力真大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. You really are freakishly strong.
