Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶  滴完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn, it's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.65,0:16:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果现在乔伊和钱德走进来  我们就发了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. y'know if Joey and Chandler walked in right now, we could make a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是钱德  乔伊或罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, that is definitely Chandler, Joey or Ross.
