Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴你打来  钱德都说了  他很难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so glad you called. Chandler told me what happened. He's really upset.
