Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.29,0:17:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  谢谢你  她玩得很愉快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And thanks, Joey. She's having a really great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.12,0:17:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是乔伊吗  是乔伊吗  我要跟他说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that Joey? Is that Joey? Let me talk to him.
