Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.38,0:17:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他连话都不想跟我说  这样我要怎么跟他道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, He won't even talk to me. How am I gonna apologize to him if he won't even talk to me?
