Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我和你没下过西洋棋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you and I have never played chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.36,0:18:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有啦  记得冰冻湖那次吗  我们玩西洋棋  你说我很无趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on! Yes, remember that time on the frozen lake? We were playing chess, you said I was boring,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你脱下面具  变成了卡麦蓉狄亚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and then you took off your energy mask and you were Cameron Diaz!.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这有可能是梦境\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, there's a chance this may have been a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  史丹利  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Stanley. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.94,0:19:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的主角来了  咱们开工吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your leading man is here. Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计划有些改变   我们停拍了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, slight change of plans. We've shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱的原因吧  我们没钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a money thing. We don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. You're kidding, right? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这或许只是暂时的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's probably just temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望能快点筹到资金  你先撑一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're hoping to get more money soon, so if you could just, uh, hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撑一下  要撑多久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hang out? How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.93,0:19:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  一周  或许两个星期吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. A week. Maybe two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,资金会出现的  大家都爱投资拍片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The money'll turn up. People always wanna invest in movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.98,0:19:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是有钱人吧  我不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you're not rich, are you? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.27,0:19:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问一下也无妨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  让我知道你在哪儿落脚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Joey, let me know where you're staying, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  你是乔伊崔比亚尼吗  我是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, pal. Are you Joey Tribbiani? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是有人留给你的  谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}These got left for you. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:12.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,," 恭喜你翻身了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Congratulations on your big break."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我是乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, it's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.95,0:20:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你当了大明星还记得我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey.Aw, you remember me even though you're a big star.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.75,0:20:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧   忘记你也要好几年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, come on. It'll be years before I forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.67,0:20:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  拍片现场是什么样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, what's it like on a movie set, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:21:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有自己的更衣室吗  有专属的私人座椅吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have a dressing room? Do you have a chair with your name on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有啊  一切都在进行当中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yeah, yeah, I got all that going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要跟钱德说  他完完全全看走眼了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, uh, make sure you tell Chandler he couldn't have been more wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我得挂了  我的寿司送来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-oh, I gotta go, Monica. My, uh, sushi's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.06,0:21:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  多谢你们等我  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry about that. Thanks for waiting. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家笑一个  好了  多谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everybody smile. Okay. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你们在凯萨住得愉快  祝福你们" 罗马" 精神\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Enjoy your stay at Caesar's. We hope it's toga-rific.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我  杀了我吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh. Kill me. Kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  《电视指南》递给我好吗  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach, can you pass me the TV Guide?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.13,0:21:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get off! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,睁开  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold it open. Okay. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三  四个小时后再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll see you in about three or four hours.
